@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### All public offers

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search


### Search Coca-Cola

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola


### Search Coca-Cola cheapest first

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&sort=priceAsc


### Search Coca-Cola most expensive first

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&sort=priceDesc


### In stock only

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&status=IN_STOCK


### Low stock only

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?status=LOW_STOCK


### Out of stock only

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?status=OUT_OF_STOCK


### Filter by city

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?city=Skopje


### Filter by brand

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?brandId=1


### Filter by category

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?categoryId=1


### Multiple filters

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca&brandId=1&categoryId=1&city=Skopje&status=IN_STOCK&sort=priceAsc


### Product A-Z

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?sort=nameAsc


### Product Z-A

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?sort=nameDesc


### Recently updated

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?sort=updatedDesc


### Pagination

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?page=0&size=2


### Next page

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?page=1&size=2


### Public filter options

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/filters


### Invalid page

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?page=-1


### Invalid size

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?size=0


### Invalid status

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?status=INVALID